{
    "title": "My Diary - Daily Diary Journal",
    "description": "My diary is a free online diary journal with lock. You can use it to record daily diary, secret thoughts, journeys, moods, and any private moments. It is a journal app with pictures and videos, that supports adding themes, stickers, font, etc. to make your personal diary journal more vivid and safe.\r\n\r\nMy Diary - Journal, Diary, Daily Journal with Lock supports setting a diary password to protect the security of your memories and private journal. You will be able to sync your diary journal to Google Drive or Dropbox to ensure security, and keep diary entries accessible on different devices. You can also export the daily journals to txt, pdf or print them.\r\n\r\nMy Diary, as a private journal with lock, will protect your memories securely. Please have a try now.\r\n\r\nReasons for choosing My Diary\r\n\ud83e\udddc\ud83c\udffbSafe and Private Journaling app - Always protecting you\r\nIt is a personal diary with lock. Set your daily diary passcode and keep your private journals safe.\r\nSupporting fingerprint diary with lock. Unlock your journal app in seconds. Never forgetting your diary passcode.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcddCustomizable, Easy & beautiful Journaling App - Always be yourself\r\n\u2b50My Diary - Journal, Diary, Daily Journal with Lock \u2b50 provide multiple artistic journal themes for your choice to make your daily journal more charming.\r\n\r\nNight dark theme, immersing into your  journaling atmosphere.\r\nChoose diary backgrounds when writing journal entries, and try how lovely your private journals will be.\r\n\r\n\u2601\ufe0fDiary sync and backup - Never lose memories\r\nSync your private diaries or daily journals to the cloud via Google Drive, and never lose any memories.\r\nCheck your photo diaries and word diary entries on different devices.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfdeFree Photo Journal app - Record moments\r\n\u2b50My Diary - Journal, Diary, Daily Journal with Lock \u2b50is a Photo Journal diary. You can write your diary journals with pictures. Make your daily journal more memorable.\r\nFree video and photo diary. Write your daily diary with more vivid pictures, recordings, and videos. It\u2019s time to say goodbye to traditional paper journals.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc53Eye protection mode - Care about your health\r\n\u2b50My Diary - Journal, Diary, Daily Journal with Lock \u2b50 eye protection mode. Turn on eye protection mode before writing a daily journal,  then you won\u2019t have to worry about writing a diary for too long and feeling tired.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude0aStickers and mood tracking diary - Care about your mood status\r\nVarious interesting stickers and emojis are updated continuously. Use them to express your feelings in your diary journal.\r\nSome moods are hard to describe with words in a diary, then you can choose mood diary symbols. Add your diary mood when you start writing private journals, and you can review your mood changes through the calendar. We wish you feel happy in your daily diary. Actually, keeping daily journals can also be a kind of joy.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddc2Tags, Easy to Search - a good My Diary organizer\r\nAdding tags to the private journal diary will make it easier to view journal entries by category. Such as travel journals, mood diary, love diary, baby diary, daily diary, pregnancy diary, work diary, etc.\r\n\u2b50My Diary - Journal, Diary, Daily Journal with Lock \u2b50 is a good diaries organizer.\r\n\r\nonline diary journal - always listen to you\r\n\u2b50My Diary - Journal, Diary, Daily Journal with Lock \u2b50 is a free digital diary journal with lock. You can write your secret diary at any time, anywhere, as long as you like. We will always be with you and listen to you.\r\n\r\nExport to TXT. PDF. Printer\r\nSupport exporting daily diary, and daily journals to TXT. PDF.\r\nWant to print the diary journal entries as a souvenir? No worries, we will help you.\r\n\r\nIt is really a good diary journaling app and deserves to install. My Diary, as a private diary, will always be with you, always listen to your voices.\r\n\r\nOthers\r\nThanks for using My Diary - Journal, Diary, Daily Journal with Lock. If you like this free diary with lock app, please give us 5 stars.\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions or want feedback. please contact us at: mydiary@betterapptech.com",
